e>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Nothing matters.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2a/Nothing_matters..png/revision/latest?cb=20211118222603\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Nothing matters.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2a/Nothing_matters..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211118222603\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2a/Nothing_matters..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211118222603 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2a/Nothing_matters..png/revision/latest?cb=20211118222603 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Nothing matters.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Nothing_matters..png\" data-image-name=\"Nothing matters..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\">Desiree Burch</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.\" title=\"A couple of Ethels.\">A couple of Ethels.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caring_Uncle_Minpict.\" title=\"Caring Uncle Minpict.\">Caring Uncle Minpict.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Nothing matters.</b></i> was the ninth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">Series 12</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 18 November 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\">Desiree Burch</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Nothing_matters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Nothing matters\" was <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a>'s nihilistic response to Greg's question about whether it mattered that <a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\">Alan Davies</a> had brought in a packet of chicken legs, for the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_goosebumps\" title=\"Get goosebumps\">Get goosebumps</a> task. The title card is of the soldier in the <a href=\"/wiki/Strike_the_soldier_with_your_throwing_paint\" title=\"Strike the soldier with your throwing paint\">Strike the soldier with your throwing paint</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Nothing_matters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Intet betyder noget', which translates as 'Nothing matters'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Millään ei ole väliä', which translates as 'Nothing matters'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Telefonlurendrejerier', which translates as 'Phone trickery'. This title is referencing the deceptive nature of the phonecalls, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Have_the_longest_telephone_conversation_without_the_other_person_knowing_you_are_trying_to_have_a_long_telephone_conversation\" title=\"Have the longest telephone conversation without the other person knowing you are trying to have a long telephone conversation\">Have the longest telephone conversation without the other person knowing you are trying to have a long telephone conversation</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Ingenting spiller noen rolle', which translates as 'Nothing matters'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Nothing_matters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alan Davies</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Desiree Burch</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Guz Khan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Morgana Robinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/40_things_that_are_all_the_same_and_can_all_fit_on_a_towel_and_are_the_best\" title=\"40 things that are all the same and can all fit on a towel and are the best\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> 40 things that are all the same and can all fit on a towel and are the best.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Have_the_longest_telephone_conversation_without_the_other_person_knowing_you_are_trying_to_have_a_long_telephone_conversation\" title=\"Have the longest telephone conversation without the other person knowing you are trying to have a long telephone conversation\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Have the longest telephone conversation without the other person knowing you are trying to have a long telephone conversation. During the call, you must not mention television or Taskmaster. Every minute, you must reveal and carry out an action from the board. If the person you call says any of the key words, you must hang up immediately. You must call someone within two minutes from now.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_the_soldier_with_your_throwing_paint\" title=\"Strike the soldier with your throwing paint\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Strike the soldier with your throwing paint. The soldier will say your name every five seconds. You may not remove or tamper with your helmet. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_goosebumps\" title=\"Get goosebumps\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get goosebumps. Your goosebumps must be revealed in the lab. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_highest_score_by_sliding_the_ducks\" title=\"Get the highest score by sliding the ducks\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Get the highest score by sliding your ducks. Each team will slide a pair of ducks three times. The duck slider must smirk at the Taskmaster whilst sliding their ducks. The winning team will receive five points per person, the losing team will get zero.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>21</b>\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>8\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Nothing_matters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/nothing-matters\"><i>Nothing matters.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70913-009\"><i>Nothing matters.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141512\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 672/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26078/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 192/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800089/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   61.141      1 -total\n 52.80%   32.283      1 Template:Spoilers\n 51.08%   31.229      1 Template:MessageBox\n 25.67%   15.694      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 16.16%    9.883      1 Template:Episodes\n  9.20%    5.626     10 Template:Link\n  2.